(target: Review Agent, Quality lens)
This diff touches performance-sensitive paths. Check for
unbounded loops or recursion without depth limits. Verify
caching has proper invalidation — stale cache is worse than no
cache. Check for blocking I/O in hot paths — use async or
connection pooling. Verify timeouts on all external calls
(HTTP, database, message queues). Check that bulk operations
use batching, not one-at-a-time. Verify pagination on data
retrieval — loading all records into memory doesn't scale.
